    linux_secure_server_perf_runtime_blockers_2026-08-14, 1, "2026-11-27 W2-3 Windows fix: pure_database.spl delete_by_key / SQL DELETE / checkpoint() MVCC+PK visibility parity fixed; pure_database_delete_visibility_spec 2/2, pure_sql_select_cache_spec 10/10, pure_sql_reopen_checkpointed_spec 1/1, pure_database_transaction_identity_spec 4/4, pure_sql_autoincrement_spec 2/2, static_listener_publication_contract_spec 2/2, db_crud_compare_driver --mode=pure-db exit 0 (5 stages). Linux Stage 2 server/benchmark comparison pending."

